l send the money to my family.

1324
01:43:43,723 --> 01:43:46,434
lf too many people come to this island,...

1325
01:43:47,560 --> 01:43:49,646
..it's trouble for me!

1326
01:43:50,772 --> 01:43:53,149
l can't work,...

1327
01:43:53,233 --> 01:43:54,984
..l can't send the money...

1328
01:43:55,068 --> 01:43:57,946
..and my family don't eat!

1329
01:44:00,156 --> 01:44:02,242
l said no more people.

1330
01:44:03,910 --> 01:44:05,995
But more people come.

1331
01:44:08,790 --> 01:44:10,875
And you...

1332
01:44:11,668 --> 01:44:13,753
You give them the map!

1333
01:44:18,925 --> 01:44:20,176
Now,...

1334
01:44:20,260 --> 01:44:22,929
..you all go home.

1335
01:44:23,013 --> 01:44:26,933
Forget this island. Forget about Thailand!

1336
01:44:27,017 --> 01:44:30,145
- Understand? Huh?
- (Bugs) Yeah.

1337
01:44:30,228 --> 01:44:32,480
- You understand?!
- Yeah.

1338
01:44:32,564 --> 01:44:34,649
(Sal) No.

1339
01:44:34,733 --> 01:44:35,942
What?!

1340
01:44:36,026 --> 01:44:38,028
No.

1341
01:44:39,487 --> 01:44:41,573
We're not leaving.

1342
